{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.098858776092529299,"x":0.088430694160166134,"y":0.14082843155172298,"h":0.014854764208215188,"c":1,"t":"PART 4"},{"t":"Nowadays, we use different products for personal cleanliness, laundry, dishwashing and","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.16860465104317357,"c":1,"w":0.65226338704427078,"x":0.090534973041650577},{"y":0.18313953476358191,"w":0.52469136555989593,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"household cleaning, but this is very much a 20th-century development.","x":0.090534975552572089,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"The origins of cleanliness date back to prehistoric times. Since water is essential for life, the","x":0.090534977435916444,"w":0.67901234944661459,"y":0.20494186035882966,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"earliest people lived near water and knew something about its cleansing properties - at least","x":0.090534984661599469,"w":0.68724278767903646,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.21937573604084026},{"h":0.013215842881668882,"w":0.24719683329264319,"t":"that it rinsed mud off their hands.","c":1,"x":0.090402883553323085,"y":0.23249097804124208},{"w":0.67901234944661459,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.25581395336869472,"c":1,"t":"During the excavation of ancient Babylon, evidence was found that soapmaking was known","x":0.090534977430505897},{"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"t":"as early as 2800 BC. Archaeologists discovered cylinders made of clay, with inscriptions","x":0.090534981207333512,"y":0.27031802129078963,"w":0.65432098388671867},{"t":"on them saying that fats were boiled with ashes. This is a method of making soap, though","y":0.28474676072350147,"w":0.66255142211914053,"x":0.090534988429665189,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1},{"y":0.29941860454347602,"w":0.37860081990559896,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"there's no reference to the purpose of this material.","x":0.090534980889691405},{"c":1,"t":"The early Greeks bathed for aesthetic reasons and apparently didn't use soap. Instead, they","x":0.088477371407922945,"y":0.31976744172519123,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.68724278767903657},{"h":0.016103886041540116,"t":"cleaned their bodies with blocks of sand, pumice and ashes, then anointed themselves with","w":0.67912597656249996,"y":0.33394448472265137,"c":1,"x":0.088430645520923487},{"y":0.34883720916913319,"c":1,"t":"oil, and scraped off the oil and dirt with a metal instrument known as a strigil. They also used","x":0.088477371474377259,"w":0.68724278767903646,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"t":"oil mixed with ashes. Clothes were washed without soap in streams.","x":0.090534986524993991,"y":0.36336866911058796,"h":0.013084819375836831,"c":1,"w":0.50823043823242187},{"h":0.014550291607320909,"t":"The ancient Germans and Gauls are also credited with discovering how to make a substance","x":0.088477356100031171,"y":0.38515901084653892,"w":0.67695475260416671,"c":1},{"w":0.68930043538411456,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"called 'soap', made of melted animal fat and ashes. They used this mixture to tint their hair red.","y":0.3995877502791525,"x":0.088477354223434002,"c":1},{"w":0.68930043538411456,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.42137809202734744,"c":1,"t":"Soap got its name, according to an ancient Roman legend, from Mount Sapo, where animals","x":0.088477354221522919},{"t":"were sacrificed, leaving deposits of animal fat. Rain washed these deposits, along with wood","h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.43604651149486107,"x":0.08847737150174273,"w":0.68724278767903646,"c":1},{"y":0.45053003552895965,"t":"ashes, down into the clay soil along the River Tiber. Women found that this mixture greatly","x":0.08847735706374564,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"w":0.67078191121419273},{"w":0.36213991800944012,"t":"reduced the effort required to wash their clothes.","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.090534979152573053,"y":0.46511627896123775,"c":1},{"w":0.63991770426432304,"y":0.48691860451813307,"t":"As Roman civilisation advanced, so did bathing. The first of the famous Roman baths,","x":0.088477361753993053,"h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.50145348825199432,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"supplied with water from their aqueducts, was built around 312 BC. The baths were","x":0.08847735641608831,"w":0.6193415832519531},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.51590106021202631,"w":0.64609054565429691,"c":1,"t":"luxurious, and bathing became very popular. And by the second century AD, the Greek","x":0.08847736081449814},{"h":0.014534882858869502,"x":0.088477388122809655,"c":1,"t":"physician Galen recommended soap for both medicinal and cleansing purposes.","y":0.52906976769120484,"w":0.60082300821940104},{"y":0.57267441882276537,"t":"After the fall of Rome in 467 AD and the resulting decline in bathing habits, much of","w":0.62139918009440109,"c":1,"h":0.015988371257085521,"x":0.088477366125638876},{"y":0.58863368664882354,"h":0.014563987898180697,"x":0.088477356105010382,"w":0.6769547526041666,"c":1,"t":"Europe felt the impact of filth on public health. This lack of personal cleanliness and related"},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.65020573933919268,"y":0.60306242665602561,"x":0.08847737714923469,"c":1,"t":"unsanitary living conditions were major factors in the outbreaks of disease in the Middle"},{"x":0.088477360180529416,"y":0.61773255800517346,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"Ages, and especially the Black Death of the 14th century.","w":0.42798355102539054},{"x":0.090469701125718602,"t":"Nevertheless, soapmaking became an established craft in Europe, and associations of","y":0.63706169899739384,"w":0.64419113159179686,"h":0.015942554451411128,"c":1},{"t":"soapmakers guarded their trade secrets closely. Vegetable and animal oils were used with","c":1,"y":0.65249963500072006,"x":0.090490740547739729,"w":0.67086741129557292,"h":0.014200575640962554},{"h":0.017227138591177749,"c":1,"t":"ashes of plants, along with perfume, apparently for the first time. Gradually more varieties of","x":0.088408976568336378,"w":0.68739639282226561,"y":0.66632757048811408},{"c":1,"y":0.68313953477718159,"x":0.090534973044910885,"w":0.65226338704427089,"t":"soap became available for shaving and shampooing, as well as bathing and laundering.","h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.7034746762010986,"w":0.67283950805664061,"t":"A major step toward large-scale commercial soapmaking occurred in 1791, when a French","h":0.016002068109591039,"c":1,"x":0.088477365805600908},{"w":0.64609054565429691,"t":"chemist, Nicholas Leblanc, patented a process for turning salt into soda ash, or sodium","h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.09053497398112631,"y":0.71937573602737093,"c":1},{"w":0.67085973103841157,"h":0.013011904290764265,"c":1,"t":"carbonate. Soda ash is the alkali obtained from ashes that combines with fat to form soap.","x":0.090502309333268111,"y":0.73266001852915363},{"x":0.092533788487064048,"w":0.58035817464192707,"h":0.014349163491257033,"c":1,"y":0.74707182346129708,"t":"The Leblanc process yielded quantities of good-quality, inexpensive soda ash."},{"y":0.76884570092670457,"w":0.63168726603190106,"x":0.090534967698818219,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"Modern soapmaking was born some 20 years later, in the early 19th century, with the"},{"w":0.67500198364257813,"t":"discovery by Michel Eugène Chevreul, another French chemist, of the chemical nature and","x":0.090491256732605246,"h":0.014200765477192845,"c":1,"y":0.78286124407669777},{"c":1,"t":"relationship of fats, glycerine and fatty acids. His studies established the basis for both fat","x":0.088477357018843752,"w":0.67078191121419273,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.79796511613194709},{"x":0.090489317826826954,"t":"and soap chemistry, and soapmaking became a science. Further developments during the","y":0.81242854868944425,"w":0.66881027221679701,"h":0.014363248440907639,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.092592580853445225,"y":0.82848837198547109,"w":0.46502059936523443,"t":"19th century made it easier and cheaper to manufacture soap."},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.81275720303455234,"w":0.059670778910319022,"t":"Test 3","c":1,"y":0.097383720788454031},{"t":"Q31","x":0.81481481544942091,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.23255813928651603,"c":1},{"t":"Q32","x":0.81687242843981878,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.034979422887166267,"c":1,"y":0.26889534864698117},{"y":0.34883720914116723,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.81481481542521828,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q33"},{"t":"Q34","x":0.81481481541835954,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"y":0.39970930216714828,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"Q35","x":0.81687242837123164,"y":0.48691860451247093,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"t":"Q36","x":0.81687242857699294,"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.58720930207721378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"y":0.66715116263226448,"x":0.81687242837766161,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.034979422887166267,"t":"Q37","c":1},{"h":0.014773345246331782,"c":1,"t":"Q38","x":0.81557377027148148,"y":0.7172368501551778,"w":0.03777913093566887},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.79796511611791132,"x":0.81687242837123164,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q39"},{"x":0.83744856034139636,"y":0.91569767466794905,"h":0.014534882858869391,"t":"111","c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378}]}